                    held at Rio de Janeiro, January 15–28, 1942; see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, February 7, 1942, pp. 117 ff. For
                    correspondence concerning this Conference, see <ref target="frus1942v05#pg_6"
                            ><hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1942, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">v</hi>, pp. 6</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
